<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins mostly $2.00 lower; butts generally 4.00 lower; skinned hams 17-20 lbs 2.00-5.00 lower, 20-26 lbs 2.00 lower; seedless bellies 1.00-4.00 lower; lean trimmings steady to 1.00 lower. - USDA</p>
<p>Trading moderate, with very light demand and moderate offerings.</p>
